the official UniXNU dual-system sources:

  scripts/dual_sys/partition.py
  scripts/dual_sys/gpt.py
  scripts/dual_sys/f2fs-shrink.c
  scripts/dual_sys/twrp.sh
  scripts/dual_sys/test_dual_sys.py
  scripts/dual_sys/dual-system-partition.md

They are included for study and comparison, not as runtime dependencies.

